 *   - ChatTopBar (with ⋯ menu button)
 *   - MessageThread (scrollable message list)
 *   - InputArea (textarea + send + Get Help)
 *   - ChatOptionsSheet (bottom sheet)
 *   - MessageContextSheet (long-press menu)
